    "explanation": "`Select()` is the projection operator in LINQ.\nIt allows you to transform or shape the data as it comes out of the query. You can use it to extract a single property, transform the data into a completely different type, or map it into a Data Transfer Object (DTO) or anonymous type.\nIn EF Core, this translates directly to the specific columns requested in the SQL `SELECT` statement.",
