    "tip": "Tools like MiniProfiler or Application Insights are essential for identifying which specific query in a complex API endpoint is causing the 8-second delay.",
    "mistake": "Guessing. Never guess why a query is slow. Always look at the SQL generated and the Execution Plan.",
    "summary": "Troubleshoot by enabling EF Core SQL logging, copying the generated SQL, analyzing the SQL Server Execution Plan, fixing missing indexes, and ensuring N+1 or client-side evaluation isn't happening."
